coding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">cf61d6e0-a559-4c0a-a740-a2eb15f1ade9</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:cf61d6e0-a559-4c0a-a740-a2eb15f1ade9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:cf61d6e0-a559-4c0a-a740-a2eb15f1ade9\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the mailbox of <a href=\"/wiki/Barren%27s_Coop\" title=\"Barren's Coop\">Barren's Coop</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;43&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-115</span> if the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Regret\" title=\"Mask of Regret\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Mask_of_Regret_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png/25px-Portrait_Mask_of_Regret_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Mask_of_Regret_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png/38px-Portrait_Mask_of_Regret_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Mask_of_Regret_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png/50px-Portrait_Mask_of_Regret_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mask of Regret\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Mask_of_Regret_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png/25px-Portrait_Mask_of_Regret_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/df/Portrait_Mask_of_Regret_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Regret\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mask of Regret\">Mask of Regret</a> was spared in Act One</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>This <a href=\"/wiki/Anti-Hag_Support_Group\" title=\"Anti-Hag Support Group\">hag group</a> of yours better not be a joke.\n</p><p><br>\nA <a href=\"/wiki/Auntie_Ethel\" title=\"Auntie Ethel\">green hag</a> kept me prisoner for years - did things I'm not going to say out loud, so don't bother asking.\n</p><p><br>\nAn adventurer saved me, and I thought it was finally over. But it's not.\n</p><p><br>\nI can't sleep. I barely eat. I keep thinking about the hag - wondering if she'll come for me. For my kids.\n</p><p><br>\nI'd rather die than let that witch touch my family, so if this group of yours is the real deal, then I want in.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>See also:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Request_to_Join_the_Hag_Survivors\" title=\"Request to Join the Hag Survivors\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Request_to_Join_the_Hag_Survivors\" title=\"Request to Join the Hag Survivors\">Request to Join the Hag Survivors</a></span></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715065650\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.062 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2234/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 36877/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10359/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.017/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1040682/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   52.685      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   52.685      1 -total\n 48.60%   25.606      8 Template:Icon_text\n 43.64%   22.990     25 Template:Trim\n 18.73%    9.869      2 Template:Uid\n 14.16%    7.459      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 13.65%    7.193      3 Template:Icon_link\n 12.08%    6.365      1 Template:Main_only\n 10.64%    5.608      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.18%    5.361      1 Template:Item_icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35136-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715065650 and revision id 328982. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}